message: "If you use this software, please cite the article from preferred-citation."
title: "cblearn: Comparison-based Machine Learning in Python"
abstract: >-
  cblearn implements comparison-based machine learning algorithms and routines
  to process comparison-based data in Python. Comparison-based learning
  algorithms are used when only comparisons of similarity between data points
  are available, but no explicit similarity scores or features.
type: software
license: MIT
